{"symbol":"SEML","yahoo":"SEML.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Sunrise Efficient Marketing Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","website":"https://sunriseefficientmarketing.com","about":"Sunrise Efficient Marketing Limited engages in the provision of industrial and commercial products in India. The company operates as a trader, distributor, super stockist, retailer, wholesaler, importer, exporter, agent, and dealer of industrial machinery and spare parts, electrical, electronic, and mechanical items, industrial valves and spares, oils and lubricants, and FMCG products, as well as pipes, pipe fittings, and sanitation parts. It also provides low and medium voltage motors, and SynchroVERT IE4 motors; blower, waterjet, and TFO motors; gear pumps and motors; worm gear; industrial lubricants and grease; LED wellglass, highbay, under canopy lights, and LED street lights; and drive products. In addition, the company offers mini, monobloc, openwell submersible, borewell waterfilled and oilfield submersible, jet, vacuum, and industrial pumps, as well as fire fighting systems; and vertical multistage inline centrifugal, horizontal centrifugal, end-suction centrifugal close coupled, horizontal split case, single-stage long coupled end-suction, high pressure vertical multistage inline, submerged centrifugal, multi stage multi outlet fire, end suction fire, self priming, and chemical thermoplastic centrifugal pumps; electrical control panel; and cable and wire products. Further, it provides services and support, and motor rewinding services. It serves textile, material handling, chemical and pharmaceutical, solvent plants, flour mills, food processing, dairy and cattle feed, sugar, distillery, paper and particle board, steel, forging, cement, and crusher and mining industries. The company was founded in 2002 and is based in Surat, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:56:12+00:00","quote":{"price":34.17,"prevClose":34.7,"marketCap":65.47,"high